\pard\sb240\sa120\cf2\f0\fs36\b 2. Welcome\par
\pard\sb0\sa160\cf1\f0\fs22 KingCalendar is a comprehensive set of VCL calendar controls for Embarcadero Delphi. Originally created by Mark Lussier and AppVision in 1995, the library was released as open source in 2018 and is currently maintained by Lance Rasmussen at:\par
\pard\sb0\sa80\cf3\f1\fs20 https://github.com/K7LER/KingCal\par
\pard\sb0\sa160\cf1\f0\fs22 Because these are 100% native VCL controls, they compile directly into your application \emdash  no extra DLLs to distribute. The library supports Delphi 10.2 through 13 and targets both Win32 and Win64. It also supports High DPI displays and Delphi VCL Styles (light and dark themes).\par

\pard\sb240\sa0\cf3\f0\fs16 ____________________________________________\par

\page

\pard\sb240\sa120\cf2\f0\fs36\b 3. What\'92s New in v3.0\par
\pard\fi-360\li720\sb0\sa80\cf1\f0\fs22 \'95\tab High DPI support: all controls scale correctly at 125%, 150%, 200% and beyond.\par
\pard\fi-360\li720\sb0\sa80\cf1\f0\fs22 \'95\tab VCL Styles support: all painting routes through StyleServices so light and dark themes render correctly. Tested with the Glow dark theme.\par
\pard\fi-360\li720\sb0\sa80\cf1\f0\fs22 \'95\tab New \cf3\f1\fs20 StyleName\cf1\f0\fs22  property on TKingCalendar: set a specific VCL style name for the component to use, regardless of the application-wide style.\par
\pard\fi-360\li720\sb0\sa80\cf1\f0\fs22 \'95\tab Default fonts changed to Segoe UI throughout.\par
\pard\fi-360\li720\sb0\sa80\cf1\f0\fs22 \'95\tab Default colors updated to system color constants (\cf3\f1\fs20 clBtnFace\cf1\f0\fs22 , \cf3\f1\fs20 clBtnShadow\cf1\f0\fs22 , \cf3\f1\fs20 clWindowText\cf1\f0\fs22 ) so they adapt to themes automatically.\par
\pard\fi-360\li720\sb0\sa80\cf1\f0\fs22 \'95\tab New component \cf3\f1\fs20 TKingWeekLabel\cf1\f0\fs22  to display the ISO week number of the linked calendar\'92s date.\par
\pard\fi-360\li720\sb0\sa80\cf1\f0\fs22 \'95\tab Support for Delphi 13 Florence, Delphi 12 Athens, and Delphi 11 Alexandria added.\par
\pard\fi-360\li720\sb0\sa80\cf1\f0\fs22 \'95\tab All source builds for Delphi 10.2 through 13.\par

\pard\sb240\sa0\cf3\f0\fs16 ____________________________________________\par

\page

\pard\sb240\sa120\cf2\f0\fs36\b 4. Component Overview\par
\pard\sb0\sa160\cf1\f0\fs22 The library provides the following components, all installed into the {\b KingCalendar} section of the Delphi Tool Palette:\par

\pard\sb120\sa60\cf2\f0\fs24\b TKingCalendar\par
\pard\sb0\sa80\li720\cf1\f0\fs22 Full month calendar grid. This is the core component that all navigation and companion controls link to.\par

\pard\sb120\sa60\cf2\f0\fs24\b TKingPopup\par
\pard\sb0\sa80\li720\cf1\f0\fs22 Drop-down popup calendar, similar to a date-picker combo box.\par

\pard\sb120\sa60\cf2\f0\fs24\b TKingDateDialog\par
\pard\sb0\sa80\li720\cf1\f0\fs22 Standalone modal date-picker dialog. Call Execute and read the Date property.\par

\pard\sb120\sa60\cf2\f0\fs24\b TDBKingDlg\par
\pard\sb0\sa80\li720\cf1\f0\fs22 Database-aware date picker. Links to a TField and updates it automatically when the user picks a date.\par

\pard\sb120\sa60\cf2\f0\fs24\b TKingNavigator\par
\pard\sb0\sa80\li720\cf1\f0\fs22 Panel with four navigation buttons: previous month, next month, previous year, next year.\par

\pard\sb120\sa60\cf2\f0\fs24\b TMonthBar\par
\pard\sb0\sa80\li720\cf1\f0\fs22 A row of twelve month-name buttons. Clicking one sets the linked calendar to that month.\par

\pard\sb120\sa60\cf2\f0\fs24\b TMonthSpin / TMonthCombo\par
\pard\sb0\sa80\li720\cf1\f0\fs22 Spin control or combo box for selecting a month.\par

\pard\sb120\sa60\cf2\f0\fs24\b TYearSpin / TYearCombo\par
\pard\sb0\sa80\li720\cf1\f0\fs22 Spin control or combo box for selecting a year.\par

\pard\sb120\sa60\cf2\f0\fs24\b TDaySpin / TDayCombo\par
\pard\sb0\sa80\li720\cf1\f0\fs22 Spin control or combo box for selecting a day of the month.\par

\pard\sb120\sa60\cf2\f0\fs24\b TKingLabel\par
\pard\sb0\sa80\li720\cf1\f0\fs22 A label that automatically displays the linked calendar\'92s current date, formatted using its DateFormat property.\par

\pard\sb120\sa60\cf2\f0\fs24\b TKingWeekLabel\par
\pard\sb0\sa80\li720\cf1\f0\fs22 A label that shows the ISO week number of the linked calendar\'92s current date.\par

\pard\sb120\sa60\cf2\f0\fs24\b TKingDateSpin\par
\pard\sb0\sa80\li720\cf1\f0\fs22 An edit box with up/down arrows for entering a date value.\par

\pard\sb120\sa60\cf2\f0\fs24\b TKingTimeSpin\par
\pard\sb0\sa80\li720\cf1\f0\fs22 An edit box with up/down arrows for entering a time value (hours, minutes, seconds).\par

\pard\sb120\sa60\cf2\f0\fs24\b TKingMDYSpin\par
\pard\sb0\sa80\li720\cf1\f0\fs22 Three combined spin boxes in one control for month, day, and year entry simultaneously.\par

\pard\sb240\sa0\cf3\f0\fs16 ____________________________________________\par

